wer\">答：汽车已经行了56km。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"ask\">\n        <span class=\"highlight\">说一说</span>\n        “84×<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">2</span><span class=\"bottom\">3</span></span>”这种列式，你是怎么想的？\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"problem-two\">\n      <div class=\"question\">\n        <span class=\"number\">2</span>\n        张伯伯把20hm²土地的\n        <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">4</span></span>\n        用来种玫瑰，其中种红玫瑰的面积占玫瑰地面积的\n        <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span>。\n        张伯伯种了多少公顷红玫瑰？\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"problem-text red\">连续求一个数的几分之几的问题</div>\n\n      <div class=\"diagram-row\">\n        <div class=\"side-question\">\n          题中的\n          <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">4</span></span>\n          表示什么意义？\n          <br>\n          <span class=\"red\">\n            <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span>\n            呢？\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"land-diagram\" aria-label=\"土地与玫瑰种植面积示意图\">\n          <div class=\"diagram-top\">20hm²土地</div>\n          <div class=\"rose\"></div>\n          <div class=\"diagram-label\">\n            20hm²土地的\n            <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">4</span></span>\n            种玫瑰\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"diagram-bottom\">\n            玫瑰地的\n            <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">5</span></span>\n            种红玫瑰\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bubble\">还可以怎样解决呢？</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula-two\">\n        20×<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\">4</span></span>×\n        <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"top\">3</span><span class=\"bottom\